      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Because \\(5^2=25\\) is odd, \\((-1)^{5^2}=-1.\\) Also \\(1^{2^5}=1,\\) so the sum is \\(0.\\)\n\nThus the correct answer is C.",
